  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 Resolve or 1 source of fresh blood</p><p><strong>Range:</strong> 10 spaces</p><p>You control an enemy's blood to lock them in place or force them away.</p><p>Choose a blooded creature within <strong>10 spaces. </strong>They must make a <strong>Resilience</strong> check opposed by your <strong>Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> or be <strong>Restrained</strong> until the start of your next turn, and take <strong>ES Damage</strong>, where <strong>ES</strong> is equal to the difference in successes. This <strong>Damage</strong> ignores <strong>Armor</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, you may move the creature <strong>ES</strong> spaces in any direction.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.8WTxNrkc2KgWhmLy]{Blood Control}</p>",
